            "subject": "feat(subagent): break out cache tokens and add run timestamps",
            "body": "Refine the per-run usage reported by invoke_agent/invoke_agent_with_model: input_tokens is now strictly non-cached, with cached input split into cache_read_input_tokens (cache hits) and cache_creation_input_tokens (cache writes, Anthropic only), and the run is bracketed by start_time/end_time UTC ISO-8601 timestamps (duration_ms retained).",
