            "subject": "feat(subagent): report per-run token usage and latency",
            "body": "invoke_agent and invoke_agent_with_model now surface per-run token usage (input/output/total tokens, request count) and wall-clock latency (duration_ms) on the success path, so benchmarking and model-comparison callers can measure cost without reconstructing it from downstream telemetry.",
